    "value": "pplx-embed-v2-late is a family of multimodal late-interaction (ColBERT) retrievers for text, images, and visual documents, built on Qwen3.5 with bidirectional attention. The models produce one 128-dimensional vector per token and score query–document similarity using MaxSim.",
